			"notes": "First public build of FamilyAddons — a quality-of-life mod for Hypixel SkyBlock.\n\n**Requires** Fabric, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin. Client-side only.\n\n### What's in it\n- Chat filters and a chat translator (click a line, or auto-translate a channel)\n- Party commands and rep check\n- Kuudra: auto requeue, key tracker, supply and pile markers, direction\n- Dungeons: auto requeue, DT title, starred mob / wither / bat highlights\n- Mob highlights and a bestiary kill HUD\n- Critter Safari tracker, per biome\n- Family Storage: every ender chest page and backpack side by side, with search,\n  and what the open container is worth\n- GFS keybinds, custom names, player disguises, a HUD you arrange yourself\n\nNothing here shows you anything you could not see yourself: highlights are\nhidden by blocks like everything else, there are no tracer lines, and the mod\nnever clicks or types for you.\n\n### Beta\nFound a bug, or want something added? There is a **Contact** tab in the settings\n(`/fa`) — a report reaches me directly, and my reply arrives in your chat."
		}
